        "valueString": "Insidious pain for 8–10/52 with no single trauma; anterior right shoulder pain radiating down the biceps, worse with overhead lifting, reaching high shelves, lifting heavy boxes away from the body, and lying on the right side. Described as a “niggle”; wife reports reduced lifting at home and poor sleep. Right arm dominant."
